{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md","title":"原书正跳跃从空集生成极小一致固定点","display":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 原书正跳跃从空集生成极小一致固定点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration","aliases":["91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration"],"display":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 原书正跳跃从空集生成极小一致固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]","[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kripke-jump-iteration — 原书正跳跃从空集生成极小一致固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2afb05d81a538d8a\" href=\"?note=2afb05d81a538d8a\" title=\"91-lem-jump-monotonicity\">91-lem-jump-monotonicity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b78700f82584ead6\" href=\"?note=b78700f82584ead6\" title=\"91-thm-iteration-convergence\">91-thm-iteration-convergence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span> 是原书十三子句算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha&lt;\\eta}\">\\((X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha&lt;\\eta}\\)</span> 从空集出发，后继取 J、非零极限取并；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 为极小固定点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}\\)</span> 为代码信息一致性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\)</span> 为全幂集固定点集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}jump\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\kappa&lt;\\eta\\;[X_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=X_{\\min}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\kappa\\;\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\;X_\\kappa\\subseteq Y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}jump\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\kappa&lt;\\eta\\;[X_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=X_{\\min}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\kappa\\;\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\;X_\\kappa\\subseteq Y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单调性给上升构造并在 Hartogs 前停止。逐对正/负子句检查：若 J(X) 同时产生一句及其否定，则输入 X 已含某个实例及其否定，违反 ConInfo(X)；基础等式分支也不冲突，非句子值只能产生负真理原子。故 J 保持一致性。递增链并若含冲突，两个代码已在某个共同较晚阶段同现，也矛盾。\n由空集一致作超限归纳，得到各阶段和闭包一致。每阶段包含于任何固定点，闭包自身固定，因此得到极小性。旧稿只假设一个未接到原书的 J_SK 在 Info_c 上良好，现在给实际 J 的构造与保持一致性证明。\n原书单步 Φ 和递归求值跳跃有相同固定点，阶段编号却不同；此定理只对已选 Φ=J 计阶段。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemma 15.7，印刷页 189–191，PDF 页 200–202；本地 Hartogs 长度与一致性保持展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-iteration-convergence","status":"resolved","id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-iteration-convergence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))","display":false},{"tex":"(X_\\alpha)_{\\alpha<\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}jump\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\kappa<\\eta\\;[X_\\kappa=J(X_\\kappa)=X_{\\min}\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\kappa\\;\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\;X_\\kappa\\subseteq Y].","display":true}],"bytes":2043,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]